16:["$","ul","b2897-parent",{"children":[["$","li","b2897",{"children":["The canvas is the substrate, not the selling point. Ask who builds the graph, because that's what you're actually choosing between."]}],["$","li","b2899",{"children":["Model breadth decides your ceiling. A canvas wired to one vendor's models inherits that vendor's weak spots."]}],["$","li","b2901",{"children":["A graph you can save and re-run is the whole return on learning one of these, so check what reuse looks like before committing."]}],["$","li","b2903",{"children":["Read the seat pricing carefully. Several of these charge per person, and a canvas that nobody else can open loses most of its point."]}]]}]
